From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Satoshi Ikeuchi <satosan.ikm@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 19:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: remoteproc: wcss-sec: describe split firmware

The secure WCSS driver accepts up to three firmware files. Allow the
auxiliary firmware names in the binding as well as the main Q6 image.

---

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcss-sec-pil.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,wcss-sec-pil.yaml
@@ -25,8 +25,9 @@
     maxItems: 1
 
   firmware-name:
-    maxItems: 1
-    description: Firmware name for the Hexagon core
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 3
+    description: Main Hexagon firmware followed by optional auxiliary firmware
 
   interrupts:
     items:
